{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/adascripting\/gettingstartedwithadascript"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"seeAlsoSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptBasics","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptLanguage","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptAnnotations","doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptLibraries"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Essentials","title":"Essentials"}],"kind":"article","sections":[],"metadata":{"title":"Getting Started with Ada Script","role":"article","roleHeading":"Article","modules":[{"name":"Ada Script"}]},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Add an "},{"code":".ada","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" file to an AdaEngine executable and run its systems without manually loading each script."}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/GettingStartedWithAdaScript","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"AdaEngine provides two ways to install Ada Script plugins:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Automatic discovery"}]},{"type":"text","text":" embeds every "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".ada"},{"type":"text","text":" file in an executable target at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"build time and generates one plugin backed by one target-level script module."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Manual loading"}]},{"type":"text","text":" creates an "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" from source text or a file URL at runtime."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"AdaEditor-created projects use automatic discovery. Use manual loading when scripts live outside the Swift target, come from a downloaded package, or need explicit error handling.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Create-a-script","type":"heading","text":"Create a script","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Add ","type":"text"},{"code":"Movement.ada","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" anywhere below the executable target’s source directory, for example:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["Sources\/MyGame\/","├── main.swift","└── Scripts\/","    └── Movement.ada"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"text"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Declare a system and its query with annotations:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["@system(scheduler: \"update\")","class MovementSystem {","    @query(Transform)","    var transforms;","","    func update(context) {","        for (var entity in transforms) {","            var position = entity.transform.position;","            position[0] += 100 * context.deltaTime;","            entity.transform.position = position;","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"ada"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"AdaEngine discovers ","type":"text"},{"code":"@system","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"@query","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" metadata and calls ","type":"text"},{"code":"update(context)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" whenever the selected scheduler runs.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Enable-automatic-discovery","type":"heading","text":"Enable automatic discovery","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Expose ","type":"text"},{"code":"AdaScriptBuildPlugin","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" to your executable target in ","type":"text"},{"code":"Package.swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":":","type":"text"}]},{"code":["\/\/ swift-tools-version: 6.2","import PackageDescription","","let package = Package(","    name: \"MyGame\",","    platforms: [","        .macOS(.v15)","    ],","    dependencies: [","        .package(","            url: \"https:\/\/github.com\/AdaEngine\/AdaEngine.git\",","            branch: \"main\"","        )","    ],","    targets: [","        .executableTarget(","            name: \"MyGame\",","            dependencies: [","                .product(name: \"AdaEngine\", package: \"AdaEngine\")","            ],","            plugins: [","                .plugin(name: \"AdaScriptBuildPlugin\", package: \"AdaEngine\")","            ]","        )","    ]",")"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"name":"Important","type":"aside","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Choose a version requirement appropriate for your project instead of a branch dependency when consuming a released AdaEngine version.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"important"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The build plugin finds ","type":"text"},{"code":".ada","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" files through SwiftPM, sorts them by target-relative","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"path, and generates ","type":"text"},{"code":"AdaScriptPluginsGenerated.swift","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" in the plugin work","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"directory. The generated plugin passes one source map to one","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":". Script source is embedded in the executable; the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"original files are not read at runtime.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Install the generated plugin in your app scene:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["import AdaEngine","","@main","struct MyGame: App {","    var body: some AppScene {","        WindowGroup {","            GameView()","        }","        .addPlugins(AdaScriptPluginsGenerated())","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Rebuilding the target after adding, removing, renaming, or editing an ","type":"text"},{"code":".ada","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" file refreshes the generated source.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"In a portable AdaScript project running in AdaEditor’s macOS game window, edits","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to ","type":"text"},{"code":".ada","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" files hot reload after a short pause, including unsaved editor buffers.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The current ECS world remains active. A failed candidate leaves the last valid","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"code running and reports the error in Output. System instances and ordinary","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"script globals restart, and startup systems run once for the new version;","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"exported scriptable-object fields survive. Changes to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"component, resource, network, or scriptable-object schemas require restarting","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the game.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The same generated source contains native backing structs and registration for","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"scalar ","type":"text"},{"code":"@component","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"code":"@resource","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" declarations. Because these declarations","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"change Swift layout, adding or editing their stored fields requires rebuilding","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the target rather than source-only reload.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Register-custom-components","type":"heading","text":"Register custom components","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Ada Script resolves component names while plugins are set up. Register custom Swift components before the generated script plugin:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["import AdaEngine","","@Component","struct Movement: Codable, Sendable {","    var velocity: Vector2","}","","struct GameComponentsPlugin: Plugin {","    @MainActor","    func setup(in app: borrowing AppWorlds) {","        Movement.registerComponent()","    }","}","","@main","struct MyGame: App {","    var body: some AppScene {","        WindowGroup {","            GameView()","        }","        .addPlugins(","            GameComponentsPlugin(),","            AdaScriptPluginsGenerated()","        )","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"code":"@Component","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" macro supplies field reflection for supported property types. A plain ","type":"text"},{"code":"Component","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" can participate in query matching, but its fields are not automatically available through the script bridge.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Load-a-script-manually","type":"heading","text":"Load a script manually","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Create an ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" when you need control over the source location or loading failure:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["import AdaEngine","","struct RuntimeScriptsPlugin: Plugin {","    let scriptURL: URL","","    @MainActor","    func setup(in app: borrowing AppWorlds) {","        do {","            let script = try AdaScriptPlugin(contentsOf: scriptURL)","            app.addPlugin(script)","        } catch {","            print(\"Could not load Ada Script: \\(error)\")","        }","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"You can also use ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptPlugin\/init(source:name:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" when one source is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"already in memory, or ","type":"text"},{"code":"AdaScriptPlugin\/init(sources:name:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptSource","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" values for a multi-file module. Script compilation,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"import resolution, and annotation validation happen during initialization.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Native component resolution happens later during plugin setup.","type":"text"}]},{"anchor":"Next-steps","type":"heading","text":"Next steps","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Read ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptLanguage","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" for annotation syntax, then ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptECS","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" for queries, component fields, and native iterator behavior.","type":"text"}]}]}],"references":{"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptECS":{"role":"article","kind":"article","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Declare annotation-driven systems and iterate native AdaECS component columns."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptECS","url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptecs","title":"Ada Script ECS"},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptBasics":{"role":"article","kind":"article","type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Learn the syntax of Ada Script before connecting a script to a scene or ECS"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"world. Ada Script files use the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".ada"},{"type":"text","text":" extension. The examples on this page are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"small pieces you can combine in one file; a game does not need a "},{"code":"main()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"function. Start with ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/GettingStartedWithAdaScript","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" to run a complete system.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptBasics","url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptbasics","title":"Ada Script Basics"},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptLanguage":{"role":"article","kind":"article","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Use Ada Script syntax with AdaEngine declaration annotations. New to the","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"language? Start with ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptBasics","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for values, functions, types,"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"properties, control flow, asynchronous work, and annotations."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaScripting\/documentation\/AdaScripting\/AdaScriptLanguage","url":"\/documentation\/adascripting\/adascriptlanguage","title":"Ada Script Language"},"doc://AdaScripting/documentation/AdaScripting/AdaScriptPlugin/init(source:name:)":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"convenience"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"init"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text